@startuml
title Option A - Modular Monolith Deployment Diagram (Requirement 6)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

node "Client Device" as Client {
  artifact "Browser / Postman" as Browser
}
node "Single Server / Docker Host" as Host {
  node "hotel-app container\nJava :8080" as Monolith {
    artifact "hotel-app.jar\nrooms + guests + reservations + payments + notifications" as Jar
  }
  database "hotel-db container\nPostgreSQL, shared application database" as DB
  folder "hotel-data volume" as Volume
}

Browser --> Monolith : HTTP :8080\nsearch / booking / management
Monolith --> DB : JDBC/SQL\nsingle transaction boundary
DB --> Volume : persistent data
@enduml
